> [@sai-sy](https://github.com/sai-sy) the config you provided will override the permissions of all agents for bash including plan, if you instead wish to specifically alter plan and nothing else, you can do (you can do this for any agent, and you can override whatever part you want, for list of available options see https://opencode.ai/config.json:
> 
> ```
> {
>   "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
>   "agent": {
>     "plan": {
>       "permission": {
>         "bash": {
>           "echo *": "allow"
>         }
>       }
>     }
>   }
> }
> ```

